[3] Upon receipt of Standing Buffalo’s bill of costs on June 30, 2025 (Bill of Costs), a direction was issued to inform the parties that the assessment would proceed in writing and of the deadlines to file their respective costs materials. As the delays set out in the direction have expired, the file is perfected and ready for assessment. I have reviewed the Court file and note that for the purposes of this assessment, the parties filed the following:
Standing Buffalo’s letter in support of the Bill of Costs, dated August 1, 2025;
Little Black Bear’s letter in response, dated September 5, 2025 (Response);
Standing Buffalo’s letter in reply, dated September 24, 2025.
